      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left(\\frac{d^3 y}{d x^3}\\right)^{2 / 3}+4-3 \\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}+5 \\frac{d y}{d x}=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow\\left(\\frac{d^3 y}{d x^3}\\right)^2=\\left[3 \\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}-5 \\frac{d y}{d x}-4\\right]^3\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nIt is a differential equation of degree 2.",
